flowchart LR
    MUTATION[Ticket mutation] --> EVENT[IntegrationEvent snapshot]
    EVENT --> ROUTING{Enabled, valid, flag, recipients?}
    ROUTING -->|no| SUPPRESSED[Persist suppression reason]
    ROUTING -->|yes| TARGETS[Pending recipient targets]
    TARGETS --> CLAIM[SKIP LOCKED claim + token]
    CLAIM --> OPEN[Slack conversations.open]
    OPEN --> POST[Slack chat.postMessage]
    POST -->|success| SENT[Sent]
    POST -->|retryable| FAILED[Failed + next attempt]
    POST -->|terminal/exhausted| DEAD[Dead letter]
    FAILED --> CLAIM
    CLAIM -->|stale lock| FAILED

